tasks.brief:
Implementation constraints: Edit src/static/style.css. Add exactly two CSS rule groups. No other edits to this file. No JavaScript, no async, no external libraries.

Behavioral specification: Add the following CSS rules exactly:

.search-hit-nav {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 0.4rem;
  margin: 0.15rem 0.75rem 0.4rem;
  color: var(--sidebar-text);
  font-size: 0.75rem;
}
.search-hit-nav[hidden] {
  display: none;
}
.hit-nav-btn {
  background: transparent;
  border: 1px solid var(--sidebar-border);
  color: var(--sidebar-text);
  border-radius: 4px;
  cursor: pointer;
  padding: 0 0.35rem;
  font-size: 0.7rem;
}
mark.search-hit.current {
  background: var(--accent-hover);
  outline: 2px solid var(--accent);
}

Acceptance condition: src/static/style.css contains all four CSS rules with the exact selectors and properties listed above.
